# wip327: K4 alone only warns HOLD FUNC + TURN K4: RANDOM (nothing changes); FUNC (key b10 in scenarios) held + K4 randomizes.
# wip326: GLO 1st press = VEL (view 15); K4 = RANDOM SOUND: the selected track's 21 libpo32 parameters get new random values,
# the extras (pan 21, rev send 22, dly send 23) stay; wip344: LEVEL (17) stays as it was; a step held = no random; K1-K3 still work
wait 300
tap GLO
expect view 15
shot random_idle.png
expect sound0.0.21 64
expect sound0.0.22 0
expect sound0.0.23 0
expect sound0.0.3 78
turn K4 1 80
shot random_warn.png
expect sound0.0.3 78
key b10 down
turn K4 1 80
shot random_blink.png
wait 200
shot random_blink2.png
expect view 15
expect sound0.0.21 64
expect sound0.0.22 0
expect sound0.0.23 0
expect sound0.0.17 101 # wip344: RANDOM never touches the volume (LEVEL)
wait 2000
shot random_after.png
turn K4 1 80
wait 300
expect sound0.0.21 64
expect sound0.0.22 0
expect sound0.0.23 0
expect sound0.0.17 101 # wip344: RANDOM never touches the volume (LEVEL)
wait 2000
shot random_after2.png
key b10 up
# the other tracks are untouched (track 2 keeps its power-on level)
expect sound0.1.17 101
# K1 still sets the OSC velocity
turn K1 20 80
wait 500
expect view 15
tap GLO
expect view 3
